==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|безъ||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*bez|t=without}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*bʰeǵʰs}} (<+ {{m|ine-pro|*h₁éǵʰs||out}}, whence also {{m|ru|из}}).

Cognate with {{cog|lt|bè|t=without; besides}}, {{cog|lv|bez|t=without}}, {{cog|prg|bhe|t=without}}, {{cog|sa|बहिस्|tr=bahís|t=outside}}, {{cog|fa|بی|tr=bi|t=without}}.

Compare typologically {{m+|en|without}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}} {{q|when in isolation or before voiceless consonants}}
* {{ru-IPA|без/-}} {{q|before voiced consonants and vowels}}
* {{ru-IPA|бе́з}} {{q|when stressed when in isolation or before voiceless consonants}}
* {{IPA|ru|[ˈbʲez]}} {{q|when stressed before voiced consonants and vowels}} 
* {{audio|ru|Ru-без.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Tatiana Kerbush-без.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}
* {{homophones|ru|бес}} {{q|only when stressed}}
* Note: без is stressed only in rare cases, e.g., бéз вести, бéз году неделя, бéз толку.

===Preposition===
{{head|ru|preposition}} {{+obj|ru|gen/partitive|catpos=prep}}

# [[without]], [[aside from]], [[except]], [[minus]], [[free]] of/from {{gloss|signifying absence}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''без''' [[вода|воды́]]|'''without''' water}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''бе́зо''' [[всего́]]|'''without''' anything}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[не]] '''без''' [[интерес|интере́са]]|not '''without''' interest}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''без''' [[сомнение|сомне́ния]]|'''without''' doubt}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[не|Не]] [[мочь|могу́]] [[жить]] '''без''' [[ты|тебя́]]|I can't live '''without''' you.}}
# [[minus]], [[less]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''без''' [[четверть|че́тверти]] [[час]]|a quarter to one|lit=one hour '''less''' one quarter}}

====Usage notes====
{{m|ru|безо}} is used before consonant clusters caused by fleeting vowels ({{uxi|ru|лёд|ice}}, {{uxi|ru|'''бе́зо''' [[льда]]|without ice}}).

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|без-}}
''Related via {{m+|ine-pro|*h₁éǵʰs}}:''
* {{l|ru|из}}

===References===
* {{R:ru:Vasmer|без}}
* {{R:sla:ESSJa|*bez(ъ)|7|2}}

